          "settings": {
            "question": "Precision Esthetic Facials & Skin Resurfacing:",
            "answer": "<p>Engineered for the Modern Practitioner, the Royal chair provides estheticians with seamless access during complex facial treatments and advanced skin rejuvenation protocols. The motorized height adjustment—ranging effortlessly from 17 inches to 39 inches via a dedicated foot pedal—eliminates postural strain and lower-back tension during full 8-hour clinic shifts. By establishing an optimal working height, practitioners maintain precise control during detailed microdermabrasion and chemical peels, delivering consistent results and superior client comfort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "EComprehensive Body Treatments & Massage Therapies:",
            "answer": "<p>For clinical spa technicians managing back-to-back body treatments, massages, and wraps, the Royal workstation adapts fluidly to multi-technician workflows. The independent electric remote control allows for silent, vibration-free position changes, ensuring clients remain completely relaxed. The four-cushion configuration, complemented by an adjustable crescent headrest and armrests, properly supports varying body types, distributing weight evenly and reducing pressure points during extended sessions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Multi-Modality Aesthetic & Hair Removal Procedures:",
            "answer": "<p>Equipped for high-volume aesthetic environments, cosmetic injectors and laser technicians rely on the Royal chair's stable framework and versatile articulation. The silent electric system facilitates rapid transitions between upright consultations and fully reclined procedures. This instant-response calibration reduces downtime between appointments, streamlining clinic operations while guaranteeing a high-end, professional client experience from initial consultation to post-treatment recovery.</p>"
          }
        }
